{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"A shield-bearer or armor-bearer who attended a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/knight\" title=\"knight\">knight</a>."},{"definition":"A title of dignity next in degree below knight, and above gentleman. See <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/esquire\" title=\"esquire\">esquire</a>."},{"definition":"A male <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/attendant\" title=\"attendant\">attendant</a> on a great personage."},{"definition":""},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\"></span> A landowner from the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/English\" title=\"English\">English</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/gentry\" title=\"gentry\">gentry</a> during the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/early_modern\" title=\"early modern\">early modern</a> period."},{"definition":"A devoted attendant or follower of a lady; a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/beau\" title=\"beau\">beau</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt19\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">A title of office and courtesy. See under <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/esquire#English\" title=\"esquire\">esquire</a>.</span>"},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt20\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <span class=\"use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt21\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">A term of address to a male equal.</span>"},{"definition":"An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Australian%20snapper\" title=\"w:en:Australian snapper\" about=\"#mwt23\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" class=\"extiw\">Australian snapper</a><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Entries_missing_English_vernacular_names_of_taxa#Australian%20snapper\" about=\"#mwt23\"> (<span class=\"biota\" about=\"#mwt24\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://species.wikimedia.org/wiki/Chrysophrys%20auratus\" title=\"wikispecies:Chrysophrys auratus\" class=\"extiw\"><i>Chrysophrys auratus</i></a><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Entries_using_missing_taxonomic_name_(species)#Chrysophrys%20auratus\"></span>), a food fish also found in eastern Asia."},{"definition":"A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:grass%20emperor\" title=\"w:en:grass emperor\" about=\"#mwt26\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" class=\"extiw\">grass emperor</a><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Entries_missing_English_vernacular_names_of_taxa#grass%20emperor\" about=\"#mwt26\"> (<span class=\"biota\" about=\"#mwt27\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://species.wikimedia.org/wiki/Lethrinus%20laticaudis\" title=\"wikispecies:Lethrinus laticaudis\" class=\"extiw\"><i>Lethrinus laticaudis</i></a><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Entries_using_missing_taxonomic_name_(species)#Lethrinus%20laticaudis\"></span>), of coral reefs of the western Pacific."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt147\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/attend\" title=\"attend\">attend</a> as a squire."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt148\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To attend as a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/beau\" title=\"beau\">beau</a>, or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/gallant\" title=\"gallant\">gallant</a>, for aid and protection."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt163\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A ruler; a carpenter's square; a measure."}]}],"fr":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"French","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\" about=\"#mwt171\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/squire#English\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">squire</a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt172\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\" about=\"#mwt172\">title</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt172\">)</span>"}]}]}